---

Before writing code, read `CLAUDE.md` (project rules and architecture), `AGENTS.md`
(Next.js 16 notes) and `docs/tasks/README.md` (parallel-work rules). Follow the task
brief in `docs/tasks/` you were given: only edit the folders it allows, build against
the existing contracts and mocks, add tests, and run `pnpm check` before finishing.
Use pnpm, never npm or yarn.
